# Ignore every env file, then allow back only the committed templates. The previous
# rules listed specific names, which meant a new one — `.env.production`, holding the
# live Razorpay secret and the field encryption key — would have been committed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.production.example

*.log
npm-debug.log*

.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
